esources in their quest. There are also magic feathers that can aid in your efforts, since they allow gamers to perform magic spells that have an impact on combat. Between your dungeon travels, players are able to explore villages to obtain valuable clues for the journey. In addition, players can use this time to update Chocobo's inventory.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/chocobos-dungeon-2", "videos": [{"id": 32593, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "rGwqyWsqc9w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rGwqyWsqc9w", "title": "Chocobo's Dungeon 2 Trailer [HD]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rGwqyWsqc9w/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2404, "name": "Chocobo"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Final Fantasy"}]}